<tr><td colspan=2><B><font size= 5>Cazic-Thule terrorism and chaos to commence! </font size=5><br>
<br>
<font color=red>Sunday, April 1st, </font color=red> beginning at<font color=red> 2 Est, 3 Cst, 4 Mst, 5 Pst </font color=red>til the fools go home.<br>
<br>
<br><font color=red>Goals of the raid: </font color=red><br>
<br><br>
Obtain decayed armor pieces for our many, many, (Have I said many?) Shadowknights and other treasures to increase our power. <br>
<br>
Cause death, mayhem, and destruction.<br>
<br>
See who can consume the most potent alcohol at one sitting afterwards.<br>
<br>
