<br>
Please have updated your level on the roster by Saturday evening/Sunday morning.<br>
<br><br>
If you are interested in a specific type of drop please E-mail me at <font color=red> Kementari@bellsouth.net </font color=red> with what you would like to be put on the list for.<br>
